{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2711,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.eukyre.betterokp7",
  "name": "Better OKP-7",
  "slug": "better-okp-7",
  "teaser": "New OKP-7 reticles for both the Dovetail and Picatinny varients!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/H5v6Q2Wx4Yo7TlcQTtFkw2QnmB1PnmrPXiEwfk0T.png",
  "downloads": 2385,
  "favourites_count": 20,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Eukyre’s Better OKP-7 is a mod designed around <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/170/better-okp-7\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SamSWAT’s old name of the same monacre</a>. Designed with the purpose of making the EBK OKP-7 optics (both Dovetail and Picatinny) have a selection of reticles to choose from for the user’s convenience.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Eukyre-BetterOKP7-1.0.0.7z</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded .7z file in 7-zip.</li>\n<li>Drag the contents of the .7z file into your base SPT directory.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Install GIF\" /></li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Showcase</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SGi4te6.png\" alt=\"Showcase\" />\nBetter OKP-7 adds a selection of 3 reticles to the optics, those being the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Simple Dot</strong> - Classic, easy to use and good for target acquisition.</li>\n<li><strong>Dot with a Ring</strong> - Similar to what BSG had before, but without the extra ring that doesn’t actually exist on these optics.</li>\n<li><strong>The Cross</strong> - The Iconic OKP-7 reticle that everyone loves, and is preferred overall by Tarkov Players.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can see these optics in use with the GIF below:\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tHcpiGF.gif\" alt=\"A GIF showcasing BetterOKP-7 in action\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Huge thanks to QwertyAlex for helping me figure out some of the C# code required to make this. mod actually work, cheers lad!</p>\n<p>Check out the WTT Discord server <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/hKRbR6yvf2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p>\n<p>If you want to, you can support my work on my Ko-Fi page, found <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mapledesigns\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
